msgid ""
"For PDF statements, we auto-detect the tables on each page. You can then confirm each"
" detected table, map its columns, and exclude anything that is not transactions (e.g."
" ads or summaries). Password-protected PDFs are supported - the password is saved on "
"the bank account and reused."
